---
import BrandMark from "../components/BrandMark.astro"; import "../styles/global.css"
---
<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><meta name="robots" content="noindex"/><title>页面不存在 — Arforge</title></head><body><main class="error-page"><BrandMark/><div><p class="eyebrow">404 · Not found</p><h1>这条任务线没有通向任何页面。</h1><p>检查地址，或返回 Arforge 首页。</p><a class="button" href="/zh-CN/">返回首页</a></div></main><style>.error-page{width:var(--container);min-height:100vh;margin:0 auto;padding:30px 0;display:grid;grid-template-rows:auto 1fr;gap:60px}.error-page>div{align-self:center;padding-bottom:12vh}.error-page h1{max-width:900px;margin:0 0 24px;font-size:clamp(48px,7vw,96px);font-weight:550;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.06em}.error-page p:not(.eyebrow){color:var(--site-muted);font-size:20px}.error-page .button{margin-top:20px}</style></body></html>
